###### Card 1: IPC / CrPC / IEA CHANGES (3 New Bills)
* **Introduction:**
   * **MoHA** introduced 3 new bills:
      * IPC → **Bhartiya Nyay Sanhita Bill**.
      * CrPC → **Bhartiya Nagrik Suraksha Sanhita Bill**.
      * IEA → **Bhartiya Sakshya Bill**.
   * New provisions — **Retributive, victim-centric, tech-enabled, simplified**.
   * **IPC new sections**: S.110 (org crime); S.111 (terrorism); cyber crimes; **mob lynching — 7 years**; police accountability.
   * **CrPC changes**: Zero FIR; mandatory videography; timelines — chargesheet (90 days) & judgement (30 days); compulsory forensics; community service.
   * **IEA changes**: Admissibility of **electronic/digital records**.
   * **Issues**: Hate speech removed; detention time increased; low bail focus; vague terms.
* **Conclusion:**
   * **MoHA**: "The spirit of the 3 new laws is not to punish but to give justice to every citizen & prevent further crimes."

